+message (Section 6.6.1).  The client closes the connection
+gracefully (Section 5.3).</dd>
+        <dt pn="section-5-2.17">Reconnect:</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-5-2.18">The client disconnected as a result of a server shutdown.
